t108","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":240.0,"y":1566.0,"w":340,"h":32},"text":"VIDEO - AV OVER IP"},{"id":"t110","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":240.0,"y":1612.0,"w":340,"h":32},"text":"USB"},{"id":"t112","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":760.0,"y":1566.0,"w":340,"h":32},"text":"AUDIO"},{"id":"t114","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":760.0,"y":1612.0,"w":340,"h":32},"text":"CONTROL / NETWORK"},{"id":"t115","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":1230,"y":1420,"w":1170,"h":440},"text":"NOTES\n1.  NETWORK SWITCH SHOWN AS A PoE-CAPABLE M4250 PER DIRECTION. THE LISTED M4250-16XF IS\n     ALL-FIBER SFP+ WITH NO COPPER PORTS AND CANNOT SERVE THE MICS, CAMERAS, NVX ENDPOINTS\n     OR TOUCH PANEL. CONFIRM THE CORRECTED SKU, PORT COUNT AND PoE BUDGET.\n2.  MICROPHONE QTY CONFIRMED AT 2x MXA925 PER DIRECTION, SUPERSEDING THE DESIGN NARRATIVE'S\n     3 CEILING MICS. TILE DETAIL (4x4) REMAINS TBC BY OTHERS.\n3.  DISPLAY AND MOUNT CONFLICTS: NARRATIVE SAYS 86\" ON CHIEF LTM1XU FOR ALL THREE; THE LIST\n     CARRIES LH85QMCEB (85\") WITH XTM1U + FCAXV1U x2 AND LTM1U x1. DRAWINGS FOLLOW THE LIST.\n4.  SHADE CONTROL IS A STATED REQUIREMENT. NO SHADE CONTROLLER, MOTORS OR INTERFACE APPEAR\n     ON THE EQUIPMENT LIST - SHOWN DASHED.\n5.  ENDPOINT COUNTS DO NOT BALANCE. 6 NVX ENCODERS AND 4 DECODERS FOR 3 SOURCES AND 3\n     DISPLAYS. CONFIRM SOURCE COUNT AND WHICH ENDPOINTS ARE CARDS VERSUS FIELD BOXES.\n6.  CAMERA PATH IS USB TO THE HUB30, NOT AV OVER IP. THE LENOVO THINKSMART CORE IS THE TEAMS\n     HOST; THE LOGITECH ROOMMATE IS EXCLUDED AS IT DOES NOT SUPPORT TWO CAMERAS.\n7.  FAR-END AUDIO RETURNS TO THE CODEC AS USB AUDIO THROUGH THE USB-SW-400, SO THE P300\n     SERVES BOTH THE TEAMS CALL AND ANY BYOM LAPTOP.\n8.  SPEAKER DISTRIBUTION (70V versus LOW-Z) NOT CONFIRMED. 10 SAROS IC4T ON 2 AMP-X300\n     GIVES 8 CHANNELS - CONFIRM THE TAP / ZONE SCHEME AND CHANNEL ASSIGNMENT.\n9.  CRESTRON AM3-212 KIT APPEARS TWICE ON THE LIST. DRAWN AS ONE UNIT.\n10. SECOND FLOOR MEETING ROOM EQUIPMENT EXCLUDED PER DIRECTION. SIGNAL FLOW ONLY - NO\n     CABLE TYPES, LENGTHS OR PORT NUMBERS ARE IMPLIED."},{"id":"t116","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2501.2,"y":136.2,"w":460,"h":86},"text":"ALLSHORES"},{"id":"t118","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":299.2,"w":470,"h":272},"text":"ALLSHORES\nExecutive Boardroom\nSystem Block Diagram\nSignal Flow"},{"id":"s119","type":"circle","boundingBox":{"x":2625.6,"y":864.0,"w":211.2,"h":211.2},"style":{"stroke":{"color":"#d8d8d8","width":1.2,"style":"solid"},"fill":{"type":"color","color":"#ffffff00"}},"text":"PSI."},{"id":"t120","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2506.2,"y":1101.0,"w":450,"h":38},"text":"PRECISE SYSTEMS INTEGRATION"},{"id":"t122","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":1308.0,"w":470,"h":200},"text":"SCALE: NTS\nROOM: 18'-6\" W x 42'-0\" L\nVIDEO: DM NVX AV OVER IP\nAUDIO: SHURE P300 / AMP-X300\nUSB: AVER HUB30 / USB-SW-400\nCONTROL: CRESTRON CP4"},{"id":"t124","type":"text","boundingBox":{"x":2496.2,"y":1596.0,"w":470,"h":120},"text":"DATE CREATED: 26/08/24\nCREATED BY: WW\nRev. 2"}],"lines":[{"id":"l3","lineType":"straight","endpoint1":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":2464.0,"y":41.6}},"endpoint2":{"type":"positionEndpoint","style":"none","position":{"x":2464.0,"y":1878.4}},"stroke":{"color":"#1a1a1a","width":1.2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"l33","lineType":"elbow","endpoint1":{"type":"shapeEndpoint","style":"none","shapeId":"s6","position":{"x":1,"y":0.5}},"endpoint2":{"type":"shapeEndpoint","style":"arrow","shapeId":"s15","position":{"x":0,"y":0.5}},"stroke":{"color":"#1a1a1a","width":2.2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"l34","lineType":"elbow","endpoint1":{"type":"shapeEndpoint","style":"none","shapeId":"s9","position":{"x":1,"y":0.5}},"endpoint2":{"type":"shapeEndpoint","style":"arrow","shapeId":"s15","position":{"x":0,"y":0.5}},"stroke":{"color":"#1a1a1a","width":2.2,"style":"solid"}},{"id":"l35","lineType":"elbow","endpoint1":{"type":"shapeEndpoint","style":"none","shapeId":"s12"